The legal texts are laws of the Republic of South Sudan, as published by the Ministry of Justice and Constitutional
Affairs (MoJCA) in "Laws of the Republic of South Sudan" (https://mojca.gov.ss/laws-of-the-republic-of-south-sudan/).
The ministry's site footer reads: "(c) Copyright. Ministry of Justice and Constitutional Affairs (MoJCA). 2023. All
Rights Reserved." The texts were read from Internet Archive captures of the ministry's PDFs (the site's TLS
certificate has expired). This repository is private; the texts are copied unaltered apart from layout, for
reference, with attribution to MoJCA, and the ministry's rights notice is recorded here in full. Anyone who
publishes or redistributes the texts should check the position with the ministry.

The arrangement of this repository, its commit messages and tools are by Lexifina and may be reused under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). This
repository is not legal advice and not an official publication.
